== Installation ==

Step 1: Upload `geetest.php` to the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory
Step 2: Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress
Step 3: Visit [GeeTest website](https://www.geetest.com/en?plugin=wordpress) and register an account
Step 4: Log in to [GeeTest dashboard](https://auth.geetest.com/login?plugin=wordpress) and create a new captcha. Then, you can get a captcha ID and key
Step 5: Enter your captcha ID and key in wordpress dashboard

